# bad_bigcorner.part -- A round larger than the drafted corner it meets
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A block 60 by 60 with corners of 5, drafted 3 degrees, so that its
# corners narrow toward its end to a radius of 2.7.  A round of 5.08
# where the end meets the sides has no room at those corners.
profile b along y 0 0 5 60 0 5 60 60 5 0 60 5
extrude box from 30 to -14 b draft 3
round 5.08 box.side box.end
